        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "WF-07: remote H3 generation -> frame upscale -> original FPS + audio -> MP4.\nConfigure the remote URL and a server-side Turbo path. The relative LoRA path is resolved on the vLLM-Omni server.\nThis preset: FL2VA server, LightX2V v1.0 768p Turbo, 5 sigma points, video shift 6, audio shift 3; 5.167 seconds -> 124 frames at 24 FPS.\nBase H3: disconnect LoRA, set steps to 50 and video shift to 12.\nRequires ComfyUI-vLLM-Omni with PR #7456 (duration input, automatic H3 aspect ratio, audio decode fix), and RealESRGAN_x2plus.pth in ComfyUI models/upscale_models."
      ]
    }
